---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title={"Spell Check is Global: The Future of Computer Intelligence in the Hands of the Many (7B+), Not the Few"}
  description={"About: Spell Check is Global: The Future of Computer Intelligence in the Hands of the Many (7B+), Not the Few. Spell check was sold for hundreds of dollars around 1981 to 1989 and is now free and built into the tools people already use."}
>
  <section class="px-6 md:px-10 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="section-label mb-4">History essay · about</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-white tracking-tight">
      Spell Check is Global: The Future of Computer Intelligence in the Hands of the Many (7B+), Not the Few
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      Spell check was sold for hundreds of dollars around 1981 to 1989 and is now free and built into the tools people already use. This paper documents that change from dated sources and explains it with the economics of marginal cost and bundling [62, 63].
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 glass-card p-6">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray mb-3">In plain words</p>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-2 font-body text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
        <li>People used to pay a lot for spell check. Now it is free inside phones, browsers and word processors.</li>
        <li>It became free because checking a word costs almost nothing to run, and it is most useful inside a tool you already have.</li>
        <li>The same can happen to other computer skills once they run cheaply on the devices people already own, so that billions of people can use them.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/papers/spellcheck/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-dark bg-brand-amber px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-gold transition-colors">
        Read → /papers/spellcheck/
      </a>
      <a href="/pdfs/spellcheck.pdf" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-amber border border-brand-amber/40 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-amber/10 transition-colors" download>
        Download PDF
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate border border-brand-border px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:text-brand-white transition-colors">
        ← Catalog
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
